@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
title Section learning path
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Before: architecture drivers / boundaries\nAnalysis domain + operation contracts" as A
rectangle "01: Principles and OO approach\nRoles, invariants, patterns, collaboration" as B
rectangle "Apply: actual component package\nClasses / algorithms / scenarios / constraints" as C
rectangle "05: Evolution and technical debt\nAssess changes, compatibility and evidence" as D
rectangle "Record: ADR + review / handoff\nActual candidate and disposition" as E
A --> B
B --> C
C --> D : when reviewing or changing
D --> C : refine affected realization
D --> E
note bottom of B
 Only 01 and 05 exist in this folder.
 Numbers 02–04 are unused stable numbering gaps.
end note

@enduml
